01:33:46,126 --> 01:33:50,372
Provide a fallback in case something is wrong with the URL.

1115
01:33:51,310 --> 01:33:56,932
So this is how we can validate and type our search parameters in 10 stack query.

1116
01:33:58,094 --> 01:34:04,740
One thing that you can also do, now I'm not going to do it, but you can take a look at that if you'd like. This is a little bit advanced,

