2105
02:59:49,070 --> 02:59:56,772
This is where the router is going to load the code and the data for the route before the user actually navigates to it,

2106
02:59:57,070 --> 03:00:01,380
so that when the user actually navigates, they are going to load as fast as possible.

2107
03:00:02,222 --> 03:00:04,900
So if we have maybe some links like here in our menu.

2108
03:00:05,806 --> 03:00:08,740
And we expect the user to visit one of these links.

2109
03:00:09,088 --> 03:00:18,084
Before the user even clicks on the link, the router is going to preload the data and the code for this route so that when he actually clicks, when the user actually clicks,

2110
03:00:18,414 --> 03:00:20,132
it's going to almost be instant.

2111
03:00:20,782 --> 03:00:23,076
