03:02:34,702 --> 03:02:39,588
So whatever we have in our load function also uh was also preloaded as well.

2139
03:02:40,622 --> 03:02:48,484
But we also have another option, so let's maybe uh let's maybe keep it simple and try it here in the home page, clear everything,

